  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "「機動戦士ガンダム ZZ」に登場の局地戦用試作型モビルスーツの立体化モデルです。頭部モノアイは別パーツ成形で上下に可動します。バックパックの左右スラスターブロックと背面の装甲は可動式です。伸縮する腕の設定を再現し、エネルギーガンを両手で構えるポージングを可能にしています。",
      "en": "A three-dimensional model of the prototype mobile suit for local warfare that appeared in \"Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ\". The head mono-eye is molded as a separate part and can move up and down. The left and right thruster blocks of the backpack and the armor on the back are movable. It reproduces the setting of the arm that expands and contracts, making it possible to pose the energy gun with both hands."
    }
